<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-10622] Undelivered ensure message to some nodes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-10622</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;We have follow case:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Grid from 5 nodes(node1, node2, node3, node4, node5)&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;node1 detect that node4 was failed and send NodeFailed message to node2&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;node2 send NodeFailedNode3 message to node3&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;node3 accepted message but does not handle because it also failed&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;node1 detect that node3 was failed and send NodeFailed message to node2&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;node2 select new next node(node4) and send NodeFailedNode3 message to node4&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;As result node4 received only NodeFailedNode3 but don&apos;t received NodeFailedNode2.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This case also valid for other ensure message which sending  one after another.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
